WEBVTT

00:12.530 --> 00:20.580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

00:20.580 --> 00:28.340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

00:44.920 --> 00:46.940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

00:46.940 --> 00:50.810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

00:52.820 --> 00:54.930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

00:54.930 --> 00:58.720
♪Be brave enough
to split the primal chaos wide open♪

01:36.380 --> 01:37.620
[Pull Strings]

01:37.620 --> 01:39.380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

01:43.040 --> 01:43.900
Little Prince.

01:50.120 --> 01:51.050
- Changshou.
- Ao Yi.

01:51.310 --> 01:51.740
Changshou.

01:51.760 --> 01:52.260
Little Prince.

01:52.280 --> 01:52.900
Changshou.

01:53.790 --> 01:55.210
Help him up, guys.

01:55.230 --> 01:55.570
Got it.

01:55.590 --> 01:56.210
Hurry.

02:10.430 --> 02:11.290
You...

02:11.750 --> 02:13.450
Nice acting.

02:14.680 --> 02:15.450
Junior.

02:15.520 --> 02:16.290
Senior.

02:17.840 --> 02:18.940
Senior, you...

02:20.190 --> 02:20.610
Junior.

02:20.630 --> 02:21.980
Give Second Highness

02:22.560 --> 02:24.130
a big thumbs-up for me.

02:26.520 --> 02:27.610
What does that mean?

02:27.710 --> 02:31.260
To the greatest rival

02:31.840 --> 02:36.380
of my acting career.

02:36.870 --> 02:37.690
Senior.

02:38.870 --> 02:40.010
Senior?

02:40.030 --> 02:41.500
Didn't catch a word.

02:47.280 --> 02:49.290
Get him to the West Hall.

02:49.520 --> 02:50.130
Hurry.

02:50.310 --> 02:51.010
Little Prince?

02:52.840 --> 02:53.610
Little Prince?

02:57.120 --> 02:59.220
Human Clan's pathetic.

02:59.910 --> 03:01.060
That guy took

03:01.430 --> 03:02.690
quite a fall today.

03:03.520 --> 03:06.410
Second Prince dragged it out though.

03:06.430 --> 03:07.290
You don't get it.

03:07.840 --> 03:10.100
Cat and mouse game.

03:10.710 --> 03:12.260
He's Ancestral Dragon reborn.

03:13.430 --> 03:15.690
No mortal can compare with him.

03:16.310 --> 03:17.500
Ancestral Dragon?

03:18.400 --> 03:20.890
Look at you. So ignorant.

03:21.590 --> 03:24.500
Second Prince is gifted.

03:24.910 --> 03:25.540
Word is

03:26.280 --> 03:27.690
he bears a mark.

03:28.080 --> 03:28.850
Called

03:29.430 --> 03:30.890
Dragon's Prophecy.

03:31.240 --> 03:33.660
Sign of the chosen dragon.

03:34.310 --> 03:35.340
In that case,

03:35.520 --> 03:37.100
Second Prince's legit.

03:38.710 --> 03:39.940
But the Dragon King once said

03:40.310 --> 03:40.940
fate

03:41.680 --> 03:42.690
is unpredictable.

03:44.120 --> 03:46.500
It may lift a clan to greatness,

03:46.800 --> 03:49.690
or leave one buried in the wildness.

03:50.800 --> 03:53.290
First Prince still rules.

03:54.940 --> 03:57.940
[Episode 7]

04:44.920 --> 04:45.490
Enough.

04:57.120 --> 04:58.490
Let's call it a day.

04:59.190 --> 05:00.900
We mustn't tire the First Prince.

05:35.920 --> 05:36.700
Your Highness.

05:38.000 --> 05:39.170
You went

05:40.270 --> 05:41.020
too far today.

05:44.120 --> 05:44.900
Did I?

05:45.190 --> 05:46.930
The King invited humans

05:47.120 --> 05:49.290
to make peace.

05:49.310 --> 05:50.460
And you were ordered to host them.

05:50.720 --> 05:52.290
Why did you poison them?

05:52.390 --> 05:53.220
Why?

05:53.390 --> 05:54.170
Si'er.

05:54.510 --> 05:57.220
Humans are snakes.

05:57.600 --> 05:58.370
I just

05:58.920 --> 06:00.660
taught them a lesson

06:01.070 --> 06:02.610
to prove our dragon might.

06:04.120 --> 06:05.100
Wrong about that?

06:05.510 --> 06:06.410
Your Highness.

06:08.560 --> 06:10.700
You'll rule the East Sea.

06:11.800 --> 06:12.640
Acting like this

06:12.640 --> 06:13.360
- will...
- Enough.

06:13.600 --> 06:14.330
Leave.

06:15.120 --> 06:16.490
I'm not in the mood to talk.

06:18.070 --> 06:19.460
Not in the mood to talk?

06:20.190 --> 06:21.460
How about a spar?

06:30.000 --> 06:30.810
Spar?

06:31.510 --> 06:33.250
I'm the Mermaid Princess.

06:33.800 --> 06:35.660
My people are born fighters.

06:36.190 --> 06:38.900
Our Pearl Elites

06:38.920 --> 06:41.410
are East Sea's finest.

06:43.160 --> 06:44.900
I'll spar with you.

06:45.190 --> 06:46.250
Qualified enough?

06:51.120 --> 06:51.900
Si'er.

06:52.270 --> 06:53.490
Look around.

06:53.600 --> 06:55.700
We've sparred here since childhood.

06:56.920 --> 06:58.250
You know

06:58.920 --> 07:00.140
you can't beat me.

07:00.270 --> 07:01.050
Oh yeah?

07:13.510 --> 07:14.290
Take this.

07:36.680 --> 07:38.340
The First Prince I knew

07:38.360 --> 07:39.980
was brave and kind.

07:40.000 --> 07:41.900
A young hero revered
across the Four Seas.

07:58.920 --> 08:00.290
I loved you.

08:00.390 --> 08:02.290
Convinced my tribe to ally

08:02.310 --> 08:03.700
and agreed to marry you.

08:10.510 --> 08:11.660
I thought

08:12.310 --> 08:13.490
your bravery

08:13.800 --> 08:16.100
would restore dragon glory
and guard the seas.

08:17.120 --> 08:17.900
But now,

08:19.310 --> 08:20.370
you are

08:20.920 --> 08:22.900
cruel, selfish, and crazy.

08:23.600 --> 08:25.410
You're a total stranger.

08:25.430 --> 08:25.850
You...

08:26.680 --> 08:28.290
What happened to you?

08:50.720 --> 08:51.490
Jiang Si'er.

08:52.390 --> 08:53.220
Remember.

08:53.870 --> 08:54.850
This marriage

08:55.670 --> 08:57.460
keeps your tribe safe.

08:58.510 --> 08:59.530
So watch it

09:02.240 --> 09:03.250
around me.

09:16.320 --> 09:17.340
This isn't

09:18.720 --> 09:20.100
the man I fell for.

09:26.510 --> 09:28.650
Ascendance Sect, listen up.

09:34.440 --> 09:36.250
After returning to your rooms tonight,

09:36.670 --> 09:38.420
you must not wander about.

09:38.910 --> 09:40.890
Any sounds you hear

09:40.910 --> 09:43.060
are matters of the Dragon Palace.

09:43.080 --> 09:44.530
None of your concern.

09:45.630 --> 09:46.890
Do you understand?

09:48.120 --> 09:49.890
Coming. Coming.

09:50.840 --> 09:51.420
Ling'e.

09:51.440 --> 09:52.300
Aunt, Senior.

09:52.600 --> 09:53.980
Changshou's hurt bad.

09:54.000 --> 09:55.420
How's he doing?

09:56.120 --> 09:57.460
Not good.

09:57.480 --> 09:58.300
Still hurting?

09:59.000 --> 10:00.820
He knew he was outmatched

10:00.840 --> 10:02.890
yet gave his all.

10:03.120 --> 10:04.490
So noble.

10:04.670 --> 10:05.580
He took a hit

10:05.600 --> 10:07.220
for our sect.

10:07.240 --> 10:08.610
Let us see him.

10:08.790 --> 10:09.420
Well...

10:09.440 --> 10:11.300
He's meditating right now.

10:11.320 --> 10:12.820
I got this. Bye.

10:12.840 --> 10:13.850
Wait. Senior.

10:16.510 --> 10:17.180
Senior.

10:17.200 --> 10:18.490
Wake up. Wake up.

10:18.600 --> 10:19.850
Safe now. They left.

10:23.840 --> 10:24.610
They're gone.

10:29.120 --> 10:29.850
Senior.

10:29.870 --> 10:30.650
You fought

10:30.670 --> 10:32.180
amazingly back there.

10:32.200 --> 10:33.010
You didn't win

10:33.030 --> 10:34.610
or lose the face of our sect.

10:34.630 --> 10:36.850
You had it all under control.

10:38.000 --> 10:39.300
You don't get it.

10:40.150 --> 10:40.890
This fight

10:41.320 --> 10:43.220
was the deadliest

10:43.440 --> 10:45.300
of my life.

10:45.320 --> 10:46.490
Deadliest?

10:46.510 --> 10:48.530
You almost won.

10:48.870 --> 10:49.580
Yeah.

10:50.000 --> 10:51.300
Winning is easy.

10:51.960 --> 10:52.890
Losing is hard.

10:55.870 --> 10:57.890
I've laid low for years.

10:58.120 --> 10:59.730
Never caught.

11:00.510 --> 11:02.010
But Second Prince

11:02.030 --> 11:04.060
saw my weak spot instantly.

11:04.630 --> 11:07.340
Tried to expose me publicly.

11:09.910 --> 11:11.850
Overthinking much?

11:12.080 --> 11:13.820
You're underthinking.

11:14.000 --> 11:15.370
Out of everyone

11:15.390 --> 11:17.010
of Ascendance Sect,

11:17.030 --> 11:18.220
why pick me?

11:18.510 --> 11:20.250
He targeted me.

11:21.320 --> 11:23.060
He knew Kuai Si was watching,

11:23.200 --> 11:24.700
and that I tricked Kuai Si

11:24.720 --> 11:26.610
and dared not show my cultivation
before him.

11:26.870 --> 11:28.490
So he threw the fight

11:28.670 --> 11:30.300
to make Kuai Si suspicious

11:30.910 --> 11:32.370
and use him

11:33.120 --> 11:34.300
to kill me.

11:34.630 --> 11:35.420
What?

11:36.080 --> 11:38.010
He's that evil?

11:38.600 --> 11:40.490
Terrifying.

11:40.670 --> 11:43.820
So ruthless and scheming.

11:44.080 --> 11:46.460
Never seen anything like it.

11:48.000 --> 11:50.250
But how did he know

11:50.440 --> 11:52.490
about my hidden cultivation?

11:53.600 --> 11:54.370
Right.

11:54.510 --> 11:55.530
Besides me,

11:55.600 --> 11:57.220
who else knows?

11:58.670 --> 11:59.890
When we entered,

11:59.910 --> 12:01.420
an extra spiritual sense appeared.

12:02.480 --> 12:04.890
A mole in the palace?

12:07.600 --> 12:08.490
By the way,

12:08.840 --> 12:10.610
back on the arena,

12:10.630 --> 12:12.530
did you perform some art?

12:12.670 --> 12:14.730
Like turning back time?

12:15.510 --> 12:16.890
Am I crazy?

12:17.030 --> 12:17.850
But why do I...

12:17.870 --> 12:18.420
Junior.

12:19.510 --> 12:21.250
Ao Yi hides a deeper scheme.

12:21.270 --> 12:22.820
I'm checking it out.

12:23.790 --> 12:24.610
Cover for me.

12:24.630 --> 12:25.820
But Elder Kuai Si

12:27.030 --> 12:28.220
said no going out.

12:31.720 --> 12:35.010
I have a grand dream.

12:36.390 --> 12:40.060
Break free from this golden cage.

12:40.910 --> 12:44.300
Awaken every lost soul.

12:44.840 --> 12:46.060
Make every dragon

12:46.670 --> 12:49.530
reclaim its true self.

12:52.480 --> 12:54.010
Ruin lies ahead.

12:54.440 --> 12:56.820
Only destruction brings rebirth.

12:58.080 --> 13:00.010
And that grand gravedigger

13:02.510 --> 13:03.420
is you.

13:08.840 --> 13:10.100
Needs more drama.

13:13.510 --> 13:14.850
And that grand gravedigger

13:16.870 --> 13:17.820
is you.

13:19.720 --> 13:20.490
Who?

13:21.320 --> 13:22.300
Who let you in?

13:22.320 --> 13:24.300
This fortress was built with my blood.

13:24.320 --> 13:25.850
Show some respect.

13:25.870 --> 13:26.980
Respect.

13:27.000 --> 13:28.060
What fortress?

13:28.080 --> 13:28.940
This quilt of yours.

13:28.960 --> 13:30.730
I just changed it this afternoon.

13:30.790 --> 13:32.820
Little Prince, still awake?

13:33.000 --> 13:33.770
I...

13:34.440 --> 13:35.980
Stop calling me Little Prince.

13:36.000 --> 13:38.060
I'm a big dragon now.

13:38.320 --> 13:39.820
Besides, I have a reason.

13:40.240 --> 13:42.100
I'm sealing my sleepiness

13:43.120 --> 13:45.220
to admire the bleak moonlight tonight.

13:45.240 --> 13:46.420
Big day today.

13:46.440 --> 13:47.490
Need your sleep.

13:50.000 --> 13:51.530
Hold it right there.

13:51.720 --> 13:52.530
Let me ask you something.

13:52.840 --> 13:53.940
Did you go out and ask around?

13:54.270 --> 13:55.100
How did

13:55.870 --> 13:56.890
my loss go today?

13:57.440 --> 13:59.650
Was it mind-blowing?

14:00.270 --> 14:02.530
Did it shock

14:02.550 --> 14:04.490
everyone's minds?

14:05.200 --> 14:05.850
Little Prince,

14:06.240 --> 14:07.250
you are mistaken.

14:07.320 --> 14:08.300
You won.

14:10.440 --> 14:10.890
I...

14:11.870 --> 14:12.530
I won?

14:12.840 --> 14:13.370
Of course.

14:13.720 --> 14:15.300
They say you blasted

14:15.320 --> 14:16.460
that human away.

14:17.080 --> 14:19.220
Right. A mere human

14:19.240 --> 14:20.820
stands no chance.

14:20.840 --> 14:22.370
Heard you got so hyped

14:22.390 --> 14:24.300
that you passed out.

14:25.360 --> 14:25.890
I...

14:26.720 --> 14:28.100
How could I have won?

14:30.480 --> 14:32.060
Little Prince, your bed is ready.

14:32.080 --> 14:33.300
Let us tuck you in.

14:33.790 --> 14:34.940
No.

14:36.510 --> 14:38.100
My bedside

14:38.440 --> 14:39.490
needs no one.

14:39.720 --> 14:41.010
My sleeping posture

14:41.120 --> 14:42.530
is too awesome for your eyes.

14:43.510 --> 14:44.890
What's so funny?

14:45.320 --> 14:46.420
Fine.

14:46.790 --> 14:48.490
We'll leave then.

14:48.720 --> 14:49.490
Little Prince.

14:49.720 --> 14:51.610
Don't overthink again

14:51.630 --> 14:52.850
about that weird thing.

14:53.910 --> 14:54.820
Leave already.

14:55.030 --> 14:56.490
I'm a big dragon now.

14:56.790 --> 14:57.820
Not scared at all.

14:58.630 --> 14:59.490
Not a bit.

15:22.840 --> 15:24.700
Good job. Rest now.

15:27.080 --> 15:28.340
Little Prince is so stubborn.

15:28.670 --> 15:31.220
Moonlight underwater?

15:31.670 --> 15:32.650
Told you

15:32.720 --> 15:35.220
no human storybooks for him.

15:35.240 --> 15:36.940
Look, he's ruined.

15:37.440 --> 15:38.060
Not really.

15:38.080 --> 15:39.850
Sounds cool to me.

16:04.720 --> 16:06.490
He's a master strategist.

16:06.720 --> 16:08.010
He must be prepared.

16:08.910 --> 16:11.490
I'll use the side gate and close in.

16:15.910 --> 16:17.940
There you are. I waited ages.

16:20.320 --> 16:21.530
Your Highness.

16:22.150 --> 16:23.530
You waited for me?

16:24.030 --> 16:24.820
Of course.

16:25.320 --> 16:27.100
Yuhu, Luye, and Liuxia are away.

16:27.270 --> 16:28.220
Just you.

16:28.240 --> 16:28.980
Come in.

16:31.720 --> 16:32.490
Yes.

16:34.960 --> 16:35.940
You're new here?

16:36.720 --> 16:38.730
What do you mean?

16:39.000 --> 16:40.490
Alright. Hit it.

16:42.600 --> 16:44.420
Since you asked,

16:44.600 --> 16:45.370
then I'll...

16:45.480 --> 16:47.130
Sing me a song first.

16:48.120 --> 16:48.890
Sing?

16:51.440 --> 16:52.060
What?

16:53.910 --> 16:55.420
I'm tone-deaf.

16:55.630 --> 16:57.340
Don't wanna ruin your ears.

16:59.150 --> 16:59.940
Fine.

17:00.240 --> 17:01.250
A story then.

17:01.270 --> 17:02.340
No ghost stories.

17:03.510 --> 17:04.700
Are you...

17:04.720 --> 17:06.010
I'm not scared.

17:06.070 --> 17:06.900
I'm just worried

17:07.510 --> 17:09.530
you won't dare walk back.

17:11.110 --> 17:11.900
Right.

17:12.200 --> 17:14.420
Dragons are so powerful.

17:14.440 --> 17:17.090
Why fear ghosts?

17:17.240 --> 17:18.660
Of course we do.

17:19.160 --> 17:19.900
Come here.

17:19.920 --> 17:21.490
Over here.

17:26.440 --> 17:27.330
Let me tell you.

17:27.750 --> 17:29.010
Under the palace,

17:29.030 --> 17:30.730
there are ancient vengeful ghosts.

17:31.590 --> 17:32.860
At midnight,

17:33.200 --> 17:34.900
on the West Hall waste,

17:35.000 --> 17:37.290
you can hear them wailing.

17:39.440 --> 17:40.220
Naturally,

17:40.400 --> 17:42.250
I'm not scared.

17:42.720 --> 17:45.420
Ghosts are less scary than humans.

17:47.310 --> 17:48.810
Humans today

17:48.830 --> 17:50.620
were total pushovers.

17:50.790 --> 17:53.220
Didn't you beat one

17:53.240 --> 17:54.380
today?

17:54.400 --> 17:55.460
You don't get it.

17:56.030 --> 17:57.980
Kings rise and fall up there.

17:58.000 --> 17:59.420
So many legends.

17:59.830 --> 18:01.290
If humans are weak,

18:01.310 --> 18:03.010
why were we pushed to the sea?

18:03.030 --> 18:03.940
What does that make us?

18:04.000 --> 18:05.420
Worse than pushovers.

18:08.200 --> 18:09.290
Then,

18:09.510 --> 18:11.810
why challenge that human

18:11.830 --> 18:13.090
today?

18:13.590 --> 18:14.420
Great question.

18:15.110 --> 18:16.860
Finally someone asked.

18:19.110 --> 18:20.250
I have a dream.

18:21.590 --> 18:24.490
Break free from this golden cage.

18:24.510 --> 18:26.730
Awaken every lost soul.

18:26.750 --> 18:27.860
Make every dragon

18:28.030 --> 18:29.940
reclaim its true self.

18:30.310 --> 18:31.700
Ruin lies ahead.

18:31.920 --> 18:34.700
Only destruction brings rebirth.

18:35.240 --> 18:36.900
And that grand gravedigger

18:39.030 --> 18:40.050
is you.

18:43.440 --> 18:43.940
Me?

18:44.920 --> 18:46.010
Me. Sitting beside you.

18:47.110 --> 18:47.940
Get it?

18:50.480 --> 18:52.290
Sounds cool, but no.

18:53.960 --> 18:55.050
We dragons

18:55.640 --> 18:57.660
used to rule.

18:57.720 --> 18:59.700
Now we're stuck in the past.

18:59.880 --> 19:01.290
That's why we're weak.

19:01.720 --> 19:03.460
We must shatter dragon pride.

19:03.480 --> 19:04.180
Only then

19:04.200 --> 19:06.460
can dragons rise again.

19:07.720 --> 19:08.980
So you plan to...

19:09.000 --> 19:12.090
As the Second Prince of East Sea,

19:12.110 --> 19:14.290
I'd lose to the weakest human.

19:14.310 --> 19:15.090
Only then

19:15.240 --> 19:17.700
will dragons learn shame and fight.

19:18.310 --> 19:19.660
For this,

19:19.880 --> 19:21.250
you'd sacrifice your life?

19:21.310 --> 19:22.250
For a dream,

19:22.680 --> 19:24.010
what's a life?

19:25.110 --> 19:26.050
Then,

19:26.720 --> 19:28.980
you picked him because...

19:29.000 --> 19:31.090
He's the weakest, obviously.

19:34.590 --> 19:36.490
Your logic is

19:36.640 --> 19:39.940
wild, twisted, and totally nuts.

19:40.790 --> 19:41.730
What'd you say?

19:44.880 --> 19:47.530
Your Highness. Tell me.

19:48.110 --> 19:50.980
What if you lost today

19:51.000 --> 19:54.490
and war broke out?

19:55.000 --> 19:56.090
If humans lose,

19:56.110 --> 19:58.090
won't that make dragons more arrogant?

19:58.270 --> 19:59.900
And if the Dragons lose,

20:00.920 --> 20:02.700
your name tarnished

20:02.920 --> 20:04.220
and the race branded as monsters,

20:04.240 --> 20:05.460
what then, Your Highness?

20:05.920 --> 20:09.010
Never thought of that, huh?

20:10.000 --> 20:10.570
I...

20:11.920 --> 20:12.900
Of course I did.

20:12.920 --> 20:13.700
Just...

20:14.720 --> 20:15.980
not that deep.

20:22.480 --> 20:24.290
I'll leave you to rest.

20:24.310 --> 20:25.140
Leaving already?

20:25.160 --> 20:26.050
Won't tuck me in?

20:26.640 --> 20:27.980
Got stuff to do.

20:28.790 --> 20:30.860
Can't sleep without it.

20:31.590 --> 20:34.010
Mostly because of the wailing outside.

20:36.640 --> 20:38.090
Wanna go to sleep?

20:39.110 --> 20:39.900
Easy.

20:47.480 --> 20:48.290
You...

20:49.240 --> 20:50.140
Good stuff.

20:56.480 --> 20:58.180
Thought you were tough.

20:59.160 --> 20:59.940
You almost

20:59.960 --> 21:01.290
got me killed.

21:06.270 --> 21:06.860
This kid

21:06.880 --> 21:08.660
is a prince.

21:08.960 --> 21:11.050
He might have a clue
about the Sea-Calming Pillar.

21:11.590 --> 21:12.980
Let me check.

21:16.110 --> 21:17.170
"A Tale of Witches and Demons."

21:20.310 --> 21:22.530
"The Making of a Dao Ancestor."

21:23.680 --> 21:24.920
"Battle Through the Netherworld."

21:24.950 --> 21:26.340
"Secret History
of the Three Firmaments."

21:26.590 --> 21:29.090
What are these trash fiction?

21:32.160 --> 21:33.290
My Future Self.

21:33.310 --> 21:35.380
By Ao Yi. Age 4.

21:37.240 --> 21:38.490
No wonder he's...

21:38.510 --> 21:39.530
Watch me

21:39.640 --> 21:41.420
shatter the old dark...

21:41.440 --> 21:42.770
Hopeless. Truly hopeless.

21:42.790 --> 21:45.940
And hold up a new dawn.

21:49.030 --> 21:51.250
Lotus Hall Treasures?

21:51.250 --> 21:52.060
[Dragon Palace Lotus Hall Treasures]

21:52.260 --> 21:54.260
[Flower Festival Bracelet]

21:55.920 --> 21:56.700
Senior.

21:56.720 --> 21:58.490
Why aren't you back yet?

21:58.590 --> 21:59.660
What if

21:59.680 --> 22:01.330
someone bursts in?

22:05.480 --> 22:06.290
Um...

22:06.310 --> 22:07.810
Elder Kuai Si said,

22:07.830 --> 22:09.220
no one's allowed in.

22:09.440 --> 22:10.290
Whatever they're doing

22:10.310 --> 22:11.090
it's Dragon business.

22:11.110 --> 22:12.290
Nothing to do with us.

22:21.400 --> 22:23.330
Elder Kuai Si.

22:23.350 --> 22:24.860
Lan Ling'e?

22:26.000 --> 22:27.620
You...

22:27.640 --> 22:28.980
Why are you here?

22:29.790 --> 22:30.570
I...

22:30.590 --> 22:33.090
Is this your room?

22:33.720 --> 22:34.380
No.

22:34.400 --> 22:35.860
Senior got hurt.

22:35.880 --> 22:37.220
I'm just taking care of him.

22:38.680 --> 22:39.180
I...

22:46.350 --> 22:47.730
What brings you by

22:47.750 --> 22:48.980
so late, Elder?

22:49.350 --> 22:53.250
He was hurt fighting the Second Prince.

22:53.550 --> 22:57.050
Checking on him as team leader.

22:57.590 --> 22:59.180
Is there a problem?

23:00.640 --> 23:01.660
Not at all.

23:01.720 --> 23:03.490
But Senior's still out.

23:03.830 --> 23:05.770
Maybe come back later?

23:05.790 --> 23:06.900
I'll call you when he wakes.

23:09.200 --> 23:10.530
Very well.

23:11.350 --> 23:12.180
Fine.

23:15.200 --> 23:15.900
Who's there?

23:15.920 --> 23:16.490
What?

23:18.030 --> 23:19.010
Elder, no.

23:24.440 --> 23:25.330
Senior.

23:25.750 --> 23:26.250
That's...

23:28.070 --> 23:29.490
He's not awake yet.

23:29.590 --> 23:31.090
Elder, maybe leave first?

23:31.110 --> 23:32.770
I'll call you when he wakes.

23:37.480 --> 23:38.180
Don't.

23:41.270 --> 23:42.660
I'd like you to take my pulse too.

23:43.000 --> 23:44.220
Feeling weak myself.

23:57.270 --> 23:58.660
How can this be?

23:59.790 --> 24:02.420
His pulse is total chaos.

24:03.240 --> 24:06.700
Could he really be badly hurt?

24:10.200 --> 24:11.090
Of course he is.

24:11.160 --> 24:12.380
Everyone saw it.

24:12.400 --> 24:13.490
My senior is so weak.

24:13.550 --> 24:14.330
The Second Prince

24:14.350 --> 24:15.770
just swooshed him away.

24:28.270 --> 24:30.660
His cultivation is trash indeed.

24:32.000 --> 24:33.570
Take good care of him.

24:36.480 --> 24:37.490
Thank you, Elder.

24:39.480 --> 24:40.250
Oh, right.

24:40.830 --> 24:43.660
Don't wander around lately.

24:44.350 --> 24:45.050
Understood.

24:46.750 --> 24:47.660
This way, Elder.

24:48.550 --> 24:50.010
Smart kid.

24:50.030 --> 24:51.380
Just a bit slick.

24:52.510 --> 24:55.660
Take care, Elder.

25:02.790 --> 25:03.530
Senior.

25:04.110 --> 25:04.770
Senior.

25:08.830 --> 25:09.490
Senior.

25:09.960 --> 25:10.860
Elder Kuai

25:11.440 --> 25:12.810
nearly scared me senseless.

25:13.200 --> 25:13.980
Seriously.

25:14.640 --> 25:16.620
Good thing I took Seven-Injury Pills

25:17.070 --> 25:18.530
to wreck my organs.

25:19.070 --> 25:20.700
How are you feeling now?

25:27.350 --> 25:28.490
Took Seven-Cure Powder.

25:28.790 --> 25:30.490
I'll be fine soon.

25:31.590 --> 25:34.250
Senior, you play it safe.

25:37.070 --> 25:38.180
What'd you find out?

25:38.240 --> 25:40.460
Where's the treasure hall?

25:40.480 --> 25:42.090
Can we swipe it all?

25:43.510 --> 25:45.380
The treasures are in Lotus Hall.

25:45.510 --> 25:46.490
Lotus Hall.

25:46.550 --> 25:47.290
This

25:48.110 --> 25:49.050
is the catalog.

25:49.550 --> 25:51.770
[Dragon Palace Lotus Hall Treasures]
Any single item in here

25:51.920 --> 25:53.250
could fund us

25:53.590 --> 25:56.050
for 20,000 years.

25:57.310 --> 25:58.530
We'll be rich.

25:59.750 --> 26:01.420
Senior, which one do you want?

26:01.750 --> 26:02.660
This one? This one?

26:02.660 --> 26:04.460
[Chiming Ring]

26:05.640 --> 26:06.530
Lately,

26:06.550 --> 26:09.570
Fairy Yunxiao's been hunting

26:09.790 --> 26:11.980
for the Sea-Calming Pillar.

26:13.030 --> 26:14.730
I'm not after any treasure.

26:16.310 --> 26:17.140
But a person.

26:39.980 --> 26:44.060
[Hall of United Spirits]

26:50.070 --> 26:51.290
Built a barrier, huh?

26:53.310 --> 26:53.980
Here goes.

26:59.750 --> 27:02.290
Junior Qi Yuan, quite the mood.

27:02.310 --> 27:03.460
It's midnight.

27:03.480 --> 27:05.770
Fish are asleep and you're fishing?

27:08.920 --> 27:11.860
They sleep, and I'll do my thing.

27:12.030 --> 27:13.140
Fishing

27:13.400 --> 27:14.980
is about willing bites.

27:16.400 --> 27:17.380
Here to see Changshou?

27:17.680 --> 27:19.620
I know the team returns tomorrow.

27:19.640 --> 27:21.900
Just got that chess itch.

27:24.200 --> 27:25.330
Let me see

27:25.350 --> 27:27.420
what you caught.

27:35.680 --> 27:36.420
Junior.

27:36.440 --> 27:37.860
Once this dries,

27:37.880 --> 27:39.420
you can still wear it.

27:42.790 --> 27:43.860
All treasures.

27:46.000 --> 27:46.860
Gotta ask.

27:46.880 --> 27:48.660
How did you catch this?

27:49.920 --> 27:51.250
Got everything here

27:51.270 --> 27:52.860
except fish.

27:54.400 --> 27:57.050
How long you been fishing?

27:59.830 --> 28:01.220
For hours?

28:03.680 --> 28:05.380
Two days and nights.

28:06.590 --> 28:08.570
Since those two kids left,

28:08.790 --> 28:11.290
I haven't moved an inch.

28:12.200 --> 28:13.380
Two days and nights?

28:13.400 --> 28:15.180
Your butt must be numb.

28:16.160 --> 28:18.290
Why didn't you go back to rest?

28:18.310 --> 28:20.090
I want to.

28:24.030 --> 28:25.940
But I can't.

28:31.960 --> 28:32.860
Interesting.

28:33.550 --> 28:34.420
Interesting.

28:39.510 --> 28:40.810
Off you go.

28:46.200 --> 28:48.490
A linked maze formation.

28:49.070 --> 28:50.770
Entry only, no exit.

28:50.790 --> 28:52.900
Changshou built this?

28:53.110 --> 28:54.490
Who else?

28:54.750 --> 28:55.980
That little brat

28:56.000 --> 28:58.090
secretly put up a formation

28:58.400 --> 29:00.570
with layers

29:00.590 --> 29:02.010
upon layers,

29:02.030 --> 29:03.490
locking this place down airtight.

29:03.510 --> 29:04.490
I was just hungry.

29:04.510 --> 29:05.980
Came out to grab fish or shrimp

29:06.000 --> 29:06.940
to fill my belly.

29:06.960 --> 29:08.730
Ended up trapped in the yard.

29:08.750 --> 29:09.770
Can't get inside.

29:09.830 --> 29:11.140
In my room,

29:11.160 --> 29:12.860
my socks aren't hung up.

29:12.960 --> 29:14.770
Why didn't you say so earlier?

29:15.310 --> 29:16.330
You didn't ask.

29:16.350 --> 29:16.810
I...

29:18.000 --> 29:18.700
Fair enough.

29:19.200 --> 29:20.420
So you mean,

29:20.480 --> 29:21.980
you can't even get inside?

29:22.000 --> 29:23.980
If I could, I'd be in by now.

29:37.350 --> 29:39.180
Don't bother.

29:40.000 --> 29:41.860
Can't get in. The yard's huge.

29:41.880 --> 29:43.380
Just crash somewhere

29:43.400 --> 29:44.810
till they come back.

29:48.200 --> 29:48.860
Junior,

29:48.880 --> 29:50.900
you gave up too soon.

29:50.920 --> 29:52.570
Changshou only

29:52.590 --> 29:55.220
cultivated for decades.

29:55.240 --> 29:57.660
No matter how sharp his tricks

29:57.680 --> 29:58.940
or clever his traps,

29:58.960 --> 30:00.900
what else could he have?

30:00.920 --> 30:01.570
Right?

30:01.680 --> 30:02.460
Just watch me

30:02.480 --> 30:04.490
break through

30:04.510 --> 30:06.380
and rescue you.

30:07.510 --> 30:08.140
Here we go.

31:27.060 --> 31:35.300
[Lost?]

32:45.590 --> 32:47.140
How did you end up like this?

32:47.160 --> 32:48.980
Why bother?

32:49.270 --> 32:50.570
Should've listened to me.

32:50.590 --> 32:52.380
Just sleep here.

32:53.200 --> 32:54.250
You're bleeding.

32:57.550 --> 32:58.980
To think I, Jiu Wu,

33:03.830 --> 33:06.700
roamed the realm for millennia

33:08.510 --> 33:09.620
and never

33:10.640 --> 33:14.290
suffered such humiliation.

33:22.510 --> 33:23.490
Alright.

33:24.110 --> 33:25.140
Two more days.

33:25.920 --> 33:27.490
They will be back.

33:29.240 --> 33:31.570
Wonder what they're up to.

33:32.550 --> 33:33.250
You know...

33:33.270 --> 33:34.810
Two more days?

33:58.200 --> 33:58.940
Senior?

34:01.550 --> 34:02.140
Senior?

34:03.310 --> 34:04.090
Junior.

34:04.590 --> 34:05.700
How is Senior?

34:06.070 --> 34:06.620
Senior's

34:07.200 --> 34:09.210
drifting in and out.

34:09.230 --> 34:10.690
Although his life's not in danger,

34:10.800 --> 34:11.460
but,

34:11.710 --> 34:12.490
he's not fit to go out.

34:12.510 --> 34:14.090
Just stays in bed all day.

34:15.710 --> 34:18.900
He sacrificed so much for our sect.

34:19.710 --> 34:20.690
Too much.

34:22.920 --> 34:24.980
Senior set an example for us.

34:25.000 --> 34:26.130
We can't slack off.

34:26.710 --> 34:27.490
That's right.

34:31.590 --> 34:32.610
Nice acting.

34:33.550 --> 34:34.210
Senior.

34:34.510 --> 34:36.210
Keep up. Don't look at me.

34:44.300 --> 34:49.060
[Outside Lotus Hall]

35:06.320 --> 35:08.340
Seven-Star Ice Coral.

35:08.760 --> 35:09.940
Look at the quality.

35:10.000 --> 35:11.260
If it were exchanged for Spirit Stones,

35:11.280 --> 35:11.860
could buy

35:11.880 --> 35:13.690
6,666 Jade Divisions.

35:13.710 --> 35:15.380
Eyes front. Don't talk to me.

35:22.280 --> 35:22.860
Your Highness.

35:28.550 --> 35:29.900
Been waiting for you all.

35:29.930 --> 35:30.670
Junior.

35:35.320 --> 35:36.090
What're you looking at?

35:36.550 --> 35:37.690
Is it that good?

35:40.840 --> 35:42.130
Stuff like this?

35:42.590 --> 35:45.530
Lotus Hall has tons of them.

35:46.070 --> 35:47.260
If you guys like,

35:47.280 --> 35:48.490
go in and help yourselves.

35:51.000 --> 35:53.490
As expected of First Prince.

35:53.840 --> 35:55.380
Filthy rich

35:55.710 --> 35:58.570
and flexing it.

35:58.800 --> 35:59.570
Well...

35:59.760 --> 36:00.860
At yesterday's banquet

36:00.880 --> 36:03.170
there were misunderstandings.

36:03.400 --> 36:05.610
His Majesty ordered

36:05.630 --> 36:08.090
Lotus Hall open today.

36:08.280 --> 36:09.860
Palace treasures will compensate

36:09.880 --> 36:12.130
for yesterday's offense.

36:13.280 --> 36:13.900
Compensate?

36:13.920 --> 36:15.490
You seafood

36:15.880 --> 36:17.090
got any real treasure?

36:17.110 --> 36:18.740
Real treasure?

36:18.800 --> 36:21.340
My little turtle is off-limits.

36:22.230 --> 36:25.420
All treasures inside are fair game.

36:25.920 --> 36:29.090
Everyone here can step inside.

36:31.190 --> 36:33.300
Even the corals outside are priceless.

36:33.320 --> 36:35.460
Imagine what's inside.

36:35.760 --> 36:36.820
Senior, wait up.

36:36.840 --> 36:38.460
I'm ready.

36:40.800 --> 36:42.210
What's wrong, Senior?

36:42.230 --> 36:43.860
Isn't this what we waited for?

36:44.230 --> 36:46.300
No free lunch in this world.

36:48.710 --> 36:49.490
Uncle.

36:54.960 --> 36:57.010
Must you ask me for everything?

36:57.030 --> 36:59.530
Are you three-year-olds?

37:00.800 --> 37:01.980
Don't hold back.

37:02.110 --> 37:04.090
Take as much as you can.

37:04.760 --> 37:05.820
Yes, Uncle.

37:08.360 --> 37:09.940
Junior, you...

37:10.030 --> 37:10.940
Together.

37:11.030 --> 37:12.010
Easier in a team.

37:12.320 --> 37:13.170
Exactly.

37:16.030 --> 37:17.380
Go on.

37:28.960 --> 37:29.610
What happened?

37:30.360 --> 37:31.090
Uncle.

37:31.110 --> 37:33.090
There are two brutes inside.
Incredibly strong.

37:33.110 --> 37:34.900
We couldn't hold them off.

37:35.070 --> 37:36.380
Beaten so badly.

37:36.960 --> 37:37.690
They must be

37:37.800 --> 37:39.340
high-rank Celestial Immortals.

37:39.790 --> 37:40.660
Not to be underestimated.

37:41.030 --> 37:41.650
Get up.

37:43.110 --> 37:44.130
My bad.

37:44.320 --> 37:45.650
I forgot to warn you all.

37:46.280 --> 37:48.650
Lotus Hall is restricted.

37:48.960 --> 37:50.490
Naturally, it has guards.

37:50.880 --> 37:51.690
With guards,

37:51.710 --> 37:53.940
clashes are bound to happen.

37:53.960 --> 37:55.690
Want riches?

37:56.070 --> 37:57.690
Prove your worth.

37:57.710 --> 38:00.460
Yet blades show no mercy.

38:00.550 --> 38:02.210
If you get hurt,

38:02.280 --> 38:05.300
don't hold a grudge.

38:08.670 --> 38:09.980
Our East Sea Dragon Palace

38:11.000 --> 38:13.010
has Four Great Warriors.

38:14.110 --> 38:15.980
Yecha and Jinli,

38:16.440 --> 38:17.490
you've already

38:17.880 --> 38:19.420
seen their valor.

38:19.880 --> 38:20.690
The other two,

38:20.880 --> 38:23.170
Captain Frog and Warrior Eel,

38:23.190 --> 38:26.300
are built like mountains.

38:27.590 --> 38:28.260
Everyone,

38:28.880 --> 38:29.650
please proceed.

38:31.960 --> 38:32.740
No need to fear.

38:32.760 --> 38:35.490
They'll match your cultivation level.

38:35.510 --> 38:36.980
Junior, I will scout ahead.

38:37.110 --> 38:38.170
What is it, Elder Kuai?

38:39.360 --> 38:39.900
Go on.

38:42.510 --> 38:43.420
After all that fuss,

38:43.710 --> 38:44.740
the Human Clan

38:45.150 --> 38:47.490
are all cowardly rats.

38:48.710 --> 38:51.610
Greedy yet terrified of death.

38:51.760 --> 38:53.090
Now they stand here, frozen.

38:53.880 --> 38:55.300
A laughingstock to dragons.

38:57.320 --> 38:58.980
You can endure that?

39:01.710 --> 39:02.690
Xuanya is willing to go.

39:07.920 --> 39:08.690
Senior.

39:08.920 --> 39:10.740
Haven't you not recovered?

39:11.440 --> 39:12.490
Don't go.

39:13.190 --> 39:14.340
I volunteer.

39:14.480 --> 39:16.210
Xuanya, don't be reckless.

39:16.230 --> 39:17.090
Those guys inside

39:17.110 --> 39:18.860
are centuries ahead of you.

39:19.000 --> 39:20.090
Let him go.

39:23.150 --> 39:24.940
I'm the team leader.

39:24.960 --> 39:27.210
Must oversee the big picture.

39:29.230 --> 39:30.900
I never imagined

39:31.710 --> 39:33.530
that Warden Jiang of Discipline Hall,

39:33.550 --> 39:35.460
a person of such noble integrity,

39:35.480 --> 39:37.300
would have her top prodigy

39:37.550 --> 39:40.210
so enchanted by worldly trinkets.

39:40.760 --> 39:41.570
Xuanya

39:42.070 --> 39:42.780
volunteers.

39:54.840 --> 39:57.740
If you insist,

39:59.510 --> 40:00.860
then go.

40:01.000 --> 40:01.780
You...

40:05.000 --> 40:05.780
Xuanya.

40:05.800 --> 40:06.530
Xuanya.

40:10.670 --> 40:12.860
I never knew what this sword meant,

40:13.070 --> 40:14.570
nor why I drew it.

40:14.760 --> 40:15.780
The sword is

40:17.280 --> 40:18.300
where the heart is.

40:18.480 --> 40:20.860
Senior's sword was never steel,

40:21.150 --> 40:23.130
but the justice in a Qi refiner's heart.

40:23.630 --> 40:26.050
Strength comes not from the sword,

40:26.070 --> 40:27.170
but from the righteous heart.

40:29.030 --> 40:30.820
Stupid Kuai Si.

40:30.840 --> 40:32.300
More dead rival prodigies,

40:32.320 --> 40:33.340
more he laughs inside.

40:34.400 --> 40:35.900
Impressive, Ling'e.

40:35.920 --> 40:37.130
Usually you look so money-grubbing,

40:37.710 --> 40:38.820
but you're quite sensible.

40:39.550 --> 40:40.210
You bet.

40:40.320 --> 40:42.340
Look who taught me.

40:43.550 --> 40:44.740
What? Something back there?

40:45.710 --> 40:46.490
Nothing.

40:46.960 --> 40:47.980
Stupid Kuai Si.

40:48.940 --> 40:52.220
[Captain Frog & Warrior Eel]

40:55.030 --> 40:56.780
Youqin Xuanya, Ascendance Sect disciple.

40:56.800 --> 40:58.490
Please enlighten me.

41:37.220 --> 41:43.000
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

41:43.670 --> 41:50.370
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

41:51.900 --> 41:57.950
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

41:58.580 --> 42:05.030
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

42:05.770 --> 42:12.890
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

42:13.270 --> 42:20.170
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

42:20.550 --> 42:27.900
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

42:27.900 --> 42:35.070
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

42:51.210 --> 42:56.380
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

42:57.470 --> 43:04.490
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

43:05.680 --> 43:11.620
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

43:12.320 --> 43:19.400
♪Alas, our story is short♪

43:19.740 --> 43:26.850
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

43:27.170 --> 43:33.650
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

43:34.430 --> 43:41.640
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

43:42.030 --> 43:49.850
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
